  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hydropower feasibility studies and infrastructure support in Indonesia (phase 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement is under Norad&apos;s Enterprise for Development Scheme (EDFJ). 

Norad supports preparation of three hydropower projects in Indonesia for tender processes. Norad&#x2019;s support will, among others, contribute to finalization of feasibility studies, finalization of environmental and social governance studies and finalization of grid connection studies.

If Tinfos is awarded bankable PPA contracts for  the three other hydropower projects, Norad will also support the construction of access roads and grid connection.</narrative>
  </description>
